# Dancing here...dancing there!

Well.. what an awesome weekend! We have just completed a day of workshops with Epizo Bangoura in Maleny and my legs hurt! Ha! It was so much fun.  Loved the contemporary/traditional mix up of the moves..we are so excited to get practicing on this routine! For those of you that don't know, we are now doing a dance co-op in Palmwoods after our Tuesdays African drumming class.  This co-op is for those of you that want to get fit! (like me) and for all of those that love African Dancing to LIVE drumming.  It doesn't matter if you have never danced in your life.. the classes are informally led and we want this community to grow.. so get on your dancing shoes and come and join us! Please bring a gold coin donation to cover for space hire. Families welcome. See you there with bells on! Bec and Nathaniel :)
